+# enter_root [dir] — cd to the hook stdin cwd (else the process cwd), then, inside a
+# git repo, to its toplevel: a worker may end its turn in a subdir (e.g. .harness) and
+# every .harness/ path is relative to the root. Outside git the cwd is the root.
